# USBT UEFI SBOM Project

## Who and what

The user is **Chair of the USBT working group (uefi.org)**, developing SBOM guidelines for the UEFI firmware supply chain. The objective of this repo (`python-uswid-sbom`) is to:

1. Keep uSWID-generated SBOMs **compliant with the UEFI SBOM guidelines**.
2. When the guidelines doc changes → **update the code and tests**.
3. When the implementation changes → **update the guideline docs to match**.
4. Use **EDK2** (open-source UEFI reference platform) as the primary test corpus.

